--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12378fb498d283642a330e1ccd91f0bf, type: 3}
  m_Name: EspejosExterior_EN
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  topMessageInitial: Rumiator is talking to you, what do you want to do?
  topMessageRespondFormat: How do you respond to the demon of {0}?
  topMessageSecondRound: What else can you tell them?
  espejos:
  - mirrorTitle: Success
    mirrorText: "You have to be successful in everything you do or you\u2019ll be
      a loser"
    responses:
    - "I don\u2019t always win, but that doesn\u2019t make me a loser"
    - Making mistakes is part of success
    - Nobody can be the best in everything
  - mirrorTitle: Blaming
    mirrorText: "You are the one to blame, you don\u2019t deserve to be happy"
    responses:
    - Everyone deserves the chance to be happy
    - People sometimes make mistakes, but they always deserve a second chance
    - I am no less or more than anyone else
  - mirrorTitle: Ideal Body
    mirrorText: Your body is not perfect, and it has to be
    responses:
    - My body is perfect just the way it is, no matter what other people say
    - I am beautiful and strong
    - The perfect body does not exist
  - mirrorTitle: Envy
    mirrorText: Everyone is better than you and has better things than you
    responses:
    - Different people have different strengths and weaknesses
    - Everyone has their own fears and problems
    - I don't have everything I want, but I'm grateful for what I have
  - mirrorTitle: Self-sabotage
    mirrorText: You are not enough, you will never win
    responses:
    - Even though sometimes I'm wrong, I can do things right
    - You don't always win and you don't always lose
    - At least I can try my best and that's worth it
